WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,590 --> 00:00:06,660
The warehouse was rented by me. The filming ended early and there are two days left on the lease.

2
00:00:06,660 --> 00:00:12,690
I also have the key here. It's safe to send it there.

3
00:00:12,690 --> 00:00:39,930
We spent 211,500 and have 88,000 left. Salaries and compensation have not yet arrived. There are quite a few people who want to leave the city.
